# bin/code-trail[.exe] and LICENSE are generated by scripts/package.mjs from the
# built Rust binary and the root LICENSE right before `vsce package` runs. The
# VSIX must ship both, so they are explicitly re-included even though the source
# tree ignores the binary in .gitignore.
!bin/**
!LICENSE
